{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54715","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日生晕，须有晕形圆。\n其形如晕圆其圆（辛本、川本作「圆圆背」），皆主邦臣（辛本、川本作「那邦臣子」）叛谋专，夺取境边田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}